:: PassageFooter
<<marxGhost>>

:: Marx Ghost Widget [widget]
/% Random-encounter ghost, appended after every passage via PassageFooter.
   Disable per-story with <<set $marx to false>>. Quotes are authored in
   story/shared/marx-quotes.txt (plain text) and compiled by build.sh/
   build.ps1 into this passage as JSON before Tweego runs. %/
<<widget "marxGhost">>
	<<if $marx and Math.random() < 0.25>>
		<<set _marxQuotes to JSON.parse(Story.get("Marx Quotes").text).quotes>>
		<<set _marxQuote to _marxQuotes[Math.floor(Math.random() * _marxQuotes.length)]>>
		<div class="marx-ghost">
			<p><em>A chill passes through the room. A bearded spectre flickers into being. You think you hear it say ...</em></p>
			<p>"<<= _marxQuote>>"</p>
		</div>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Marx Ghost Stylesheet [stylesheet]
.marx-ghost {
	margin-top: 2em;
	padding: 0.75em 1em;
	border-left: 2px solid #4a4a52;
	font-style: italic;
	color: #a9a9b2;
}

.marx-ghost-attrib {
	margin-top: 0.5em;
	font-style: normal;
	text-align: right;
}
